  "reason": "The existing evidence is entirely absent, so the first experiment should test a foundational multimodal configuration to assess whether combining RNA and image data improves performance. This experiment tests the basic multimodal setup with PCA and ResNet50 encoders, no aggregation, and simple concatenation fusion. It clarifies the baseline effectiveness of multimodal approaches, which is critical for determining if further complexity (e.g., transformers, weighted fusion) is warranted."  
